# THIS LIST MAY ONLY SHRINK. Annotate the property and delete its line, then lower
# ExpectedBaselineCount in ConfigFieldCoverageFenceArchitectureTests to match.
# Never add an entry to silence a newly added property - that is the drift this fence stops.
#
